 Design an LLM Evaluation & Testing System
 LLM Evaluation Evals LLM as Judge Regression Testing Benchmark Design RAGAS 

 Problem Statement 
 Design a comprehensive LLM evaluation system for a production AI product. Cover automatic evals, human evals, LLM-as-judge, regression suites, benchmark design, and continuous monitoring. This is the most critical and least understood part of shipping reliable AI products.

 How to practice 
 How to practice

 No API key. Eval layers use in-process functions and a mock judge_llm that returns fixed JSON ( {"score": 5, ...} ), not production API calls.

 What to build: exact_match , regex_match , llm_judge , RegressionSuite.run , and ProductionMonitor (sample + drift alert when rolling score drops more than 5 points vs baseline).

 Run Code calls check_eval_system(check_name) (6 checks). Solution tab has the reference implementation.

 Interview goal: Separate fast deterministic gates from slower LLM-judge suites and production sampling (never eval 100% of live traffic).

